me_self_discovery_no_llm; this artifact has random_seed=42 and NO reproducibility_checksum. It cannot be back-computed from a completed run and will NOT be fabricated. (3) The script reads engine internals (env._game and env._game.yfbjozweime) for ground-truth piece/target pairs, so 'self_discovery' in the substrate name describes the OFFLINE-ARCADE-no-LLM half of the value, not a claim that the live agent discovered this game unaided; the legal set offers no more precise value. Treat the solve_provenance as development_proxy at best.",
